{"id": "EUVD-2026-98161", "enisaUuid": "76376b49-c011-3323-8afd-15a9e83fb894", "description": "Frappe Framework before 15.120.0 and 16.x before 16.33.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the whitelisted send_sms API endpoint, which does not verify that the caller is permitted to send SMS messages. Users lacking the required permissions can invoke send_sms to send arbitrary SMS messages that impersonate the Company.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T22:21:52", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T13:34:45", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/frappe/security/advisories/GHSA-wrh5-p77r-jpvq", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/frappe-before-16.33.0-broken-authorization-via-send-sms-endpoint"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109598", "GHSA-j49c-82x7-m2c6"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.19, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "38d8f68f-a36b-3c36-a674-8ecfcd653bde", "product": {"name": "frappe", "vendor": {"name": "Elated-Themes"}}, "product_version": "16.0.0-beta.1 <16.33.0"}, {"id": "858a3348-29fb-31de-8828-0405ae2d44f7", "product": {"name": "frappe", "vendor": {"name": "Elated-Themes"}}, "product_version": "0 <15.120.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "2b6b5786-8739-315e-9b90-1688ef0a5221", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}